This product has no bundled third-party code (it has zero runtime
dependencies). At runtime it queries the following public data sources; each
remains the property of its respective provider and is used under its own terms:

  - OSV.dev (Open Source Vulnerabilities) advisory database, operated by the
    Open Source Security Foundation (OpenSSF) - https://osv.dev
  - CISA Known Exploited Vulnerabilities (KEV) Catalog, U.S. Cybersecurity and
    Infrastructure Security Agency - https://www.cisa.gov/kev
  - EPSS (Exploit Prediction Scoring System), FIRST.org - https://www.first.org/epss

OWASP Top 10 category names are referenced under the OWASP Foundation's terms.
